# Providers (YAML + Worker SDK)

- Config: Traefik v3 FileProvider style — `services` + `providers` in `PROVIDERS_CONFIG`
- Builtin names only: `smtp_email`, `inapp` (`type: builtin`, no `service`)
- Remote: `type: remote` + `service` referencing a defined service endpoint
- Hot reload via fsnotify; reject invalid YAML and keep previous table
- Health: service-level `healthCheck` polling; unhealthy → retryable remote failure
- Results: default `DELIVERY_RESULT_MODE=async` — Worker publishes `DeliveryResultEvent` to Redis; Herald waits by `taskId`
- User workers: `sdk/worker.RegisterProvider` + `Run`; expose `POST /delivery` and `GET /health`
- Contract: `pkg/contract`

Full guide: `docs/PROVIDERS.md`
